# Nightly backlog states whose exact commit passed the full hosted vector gate (#2033).
# The 9700X runs the measured compiler, using the same commands and CPU grants as correctness.tests.
== Test the C lexer
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-lexer
== Test the backend's baked tables
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-baked-tables
== Test deferred function bodies against source order
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-checker-deferred
== Test the direct path's executables [8 CPUs]
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-executable
